The_wind_moves_gently_over_the_valley.__|The_trees_are_quiet_beside_the_river.___|A_small_bird_waits_for_the_morning_sun._|Its_wings_carry_it_towards_the_fields.__|Across_the_road_a_farmer_opens_a_gate.__|The_clouds_above_are_slowly_moving_on.__|Some_rain_will_come_before_the_evening._|The_people_gather_water_for_their_crops.|They_work_together_until_it_grows_dark._|At_last_they_return_to_their_warm_homes.
